{"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"tokens":[{"text":"@property","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" (","kind":"text"},{"text":"nonatomic","kind":"keyword"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"weak","kind":"keyword"},{"text":") ","kind":"text"},{"text":"id<MLNMapSnapshotterDelegate>","preciseIdentifier":"c:Qoobjc(pl)MLNMapSnapshotterDelegate","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"delegate","kind":"identifier"},{"text":";","kind":"text"}],"platforms":["iOS","iPadOS","Mac Catalyst"],"languages":["occ"]}]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"text":"Discussion","anchor":"discussion","level":2,"type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The delegate is responsible for responding to significant changes during the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"snapshotting process, such as the style loading. Implement a delegate to"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"customize the style that is depicted by the snapshot."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"You set the delegate after initializing the snapshotter but before receiving"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the snapshot, typically before starting the snapshot. The snapshotter keeps a"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"weak reference to its delegate, so you must keep a strong reference to it to"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"ensure that your style customizations apply."}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"kind":"symbol","abstract":[{"text":"The snapshotter’s delegate.","type":"text"}],"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNMapSnapshotter\/delegate","interfaceLanguage":"occ"},"schemaVersion":{"patch":0,"minor":3,"major":0},"sections":[],"metadata":{"role":"symbol","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"delegate","kind":"identifier"}],"roleHeading":"Instance Property","title":"delegate","modules":[{"name":"MapLibre"}],"fragments":[{"text":"de